e the failure was too convenient (a just-deployed feature vanishing) and because the DOM snapshot rendered a string, `The county waits for its first name.`, that `grep` proved absent from `src/`. **That contradiction is the tell: when the page shows copy your tree does not contain, suspect the instrument, not the tree.**
